sequenceDiagram
    %% Service Provider Complete Journey from Login to Business Outcome

    autonumber
    actor Provider as Service Provider
    participant Auth as Auth & Credentialing
    participant Dash as Provider Dashboard (/dashboard/serviceprovider)
    participant Catalog as Service Catalog (/marketplace/services)
    actor Client as Client (Founder/Creator)
    participant Workroom as Workroom Engine (/api/workroom)
    participant Earnings as Earnings & Payout Engine

    %% Verification & Setup
    Provider->>Auth: Register & Submit Professional Proof of Work
    Auth->>Auth: Admin Certifies Provider as "Tier 2: Verified"
    Auth-->>Dash: Redirect to /dashboard/serviceprovider

    %% Catalog Publishing
    Dash->>Catalog: Publish Service: "Institutional Pitch Deck & Financial Model"
    Dash->>Catalog: Configure Tiered Packages (Basic €500, Pro €1,500, Enterprise €3,500)

    %% Lead Ingress & Proposal
    Client->>Catalog: Discover Listing & Order "Pro Package" (€1,500)
    Client->>Workroom: Fund Escrow (€1,500 held securely)
    Workroom->>Workroom: Form Contract & Generate 2 Milestones

    %% Delivery & Revision
    Provider->>Workroom: Upload Milestone 1 Deliverable (Financial Model)
    Client->>Workroom: Request Minor Revision
    Provider->>Workroom: Upload Revised Model
    Client->>Workroom: Accept Milestone 1 (Release 50% Escrow: €750)
    Provider->>Workroom: Upload Milestone 2 Deliverable (Pitch Deck)
    Client->>Workroom: Accept Milestone 2 (Release remaining 50%: €750)

    %% Earnings & Payout
    Workroom->>Earnings: Transfer €1,500 to Available Balance
    Earnings->>Earnings: Generate Official Tax Invoice PDF
    Provider->>Earnings: Request Bank Payout (Logged to PayoutRequests)
    Client->>Workroom: Submit 5-Star Rating & Written Testimonial
    Earnings-->>Provider: Business Outcome: Application-Modeled Escrow Settlement & Platform Reputation Growth (Live Gateway via Adapter)
